<title>MOLDOVA: Moldovan discount rate steady at 18 pct.</title>
<headline>Moldovan discount rate steady at 18 pct.</headline>
<dateline>CHISINAU 1997-07-07</dateline>
<text>
<p>The Moldovan National Bank said on Monday its official discount rate was unchanged at 18 percent annual.</p>
<p>The rate, in place since June 16, held at a credit funds auction where seven banks acquired 12.18 million lei ($2.68 million) of National Bank reserves.</p>
